<title>HONG KONG: Climax Int'l interim net down 26.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Climax Int'l interim net down 26.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.90     vs 11.62</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.2	vs 1.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  7.3 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    33.69    vs 45.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		     338.25   vs 321.95</p>
<p>    Company name		 Climax International Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Dec 28, 1996 to Jan 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Jan 17, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Climax International is a paper product manufacturer.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents market research expenses, consultancy fees and other costs associated with setting up the distribution network of branded products business in the Asia Pacific region and the related reorganization of the group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
